{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUPITER</strong>, where even the smallest mistake can lead you to disaster, is a cooperative space survival game. Play as a lost alien, either alone or with a team. The only way to escape from a mysterious planet is to find the signal on the planet. Will you survive this planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP OR HURT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out of this 'Fault Line' is cooperation... or is it? Reach out to your friends to climb, slide, and avoid dangers. Or send them back to the depths with a little &quot;accident.&quot; In this place where trust is a luxury, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEND A SIGNAL HOME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The signal device in the escape pod is your only hope. But to make it work, you need to reach the highest point of the 'Fault Line.' Set up the device, test the signal, and keep aiming higher to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DANGER AROUND EVERY CORNER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything on this planet is cute. Avoid becoming food for sound-sensitive plants, dodge plants that suddenly shoot pollen, and... whatever you do, don\u2019t wake the 'Sleeping Rock.' Seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALIEN GEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you didn't come empty-handed. Use the jetpack for short distances, remove obstacles with the Gravity Gun, make quick escapes with the Teleporter. But most importantly: always monitor your 'Nitrogen' tank. The air you breathe isn\u2019t oxygen, and if it runs out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative (Co-op)</strong> Adventure: Try to escape the 'Fault Line' with friends or alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Physics: Help each other or make things harder for one another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical World: Smooth movement mechanics based on climbing, sliding, and dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Flora: Unpredictable plants and rock enemies that react to sound and touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Technology: Vital gear like Jetpack, Gravity Gun, Headlight, and Teleporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitrogen Management: Not oxygen, Nitrogen! Manage the air you breathe carefully, or you\u2019ll suffocate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal Quest: Constantly aim higher to climb and return home.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970800?t=1771608168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/639097ec54840cc0aa64ca96ee6ccc5e7cf00445/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771608168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/af41b8e2da126c6ca56188b07be719c7dffee701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771608168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/af41b8e2da126c6ca56188b07be719c7dffee701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771608168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild fantasy violence and adventure elements. There is no blood, strong language, sexual content, or drug use. The focus is on exploration and survival in a mysterious world. Suitable for younger audiences as well as adults."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUPITER</strong>, where even the smallest mistake can lead you to disaster, is a cooperative space survival game. Play as a lost alien, either alone or with a team. The only way to escape from a mysterious planet is to find the signal on the planet. Will you survive this planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP OR HURT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out of this 'Fault Line' is cooperation... or is it? Reach out to your friends to climb, slide, and avoid dangers. Or send them back to the depths with a little &quot;accident.&quot; In this place where trust is a luxury, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEND A SIGNAL HOME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The signal device in the escape pod is your only hope. But to make it work, you need to reach the highest point of the 'Fault Line.' Set up the device, test the signal, and keep aiming higher to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DANGER AROUND EVERY CORNER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything on this planet is cute. Avoid becoming food for sound-sensitive plants, dodge plants that suddenly shoot pollen, and... whatever you do, don\u2019t wake the 'Sleeping Rock.' Seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALIEN GEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you didn't come empty-handed. Use the jetpack for short distances, remove obstacles with the Gravity Gun, make quick escapes with the Teleporter. But most importantly: always monitor your 'Nitrogen' tank. The air you breathe isn\u2019t oxygen, and if it runs out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative (Co-op)</strong> Adventure: Try to escape the 'Fault Line' with friends or alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Physics: Help each other or make things harder for one another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical World: Smooth movement mechanics based on climbing, sliding, and dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.mp4?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Flora: Unpredictable plants and rock enemies that react to sound and touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Technology: Vital gear like Jetpack, Gravity Gun, Headlight, and Teleporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.poster.avif?t=1771608168\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.webm?t=1771608168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb